          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_crucially_whether_weight_asymmetry_a",
          "text": "And crucially, whether weight asymmetry actually harms learning had never been pinned down, because in practice its effect gets tangled up with the error introduced by using a finite nudge.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
