        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_but_backpropagation_workhorse_deep_l",
          "text": "But backpropagation, the workhorse of deep learning, needs a separate linear backward pass and the exact transpose of every weight matrix, neither of which physical substrates provide naturally.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
