          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_warning_sign_asymmetric_version_had",
          "text": "And there was a warning sign: the asymmetric version of EP had only ever worked on toy tasks like MNIST and outright failed on CIFAR-10. Nobody had explained why.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
