        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_second_extends_holomorphic_asymmetri",
          "text": "Second, it extends holomorphic EP to asymmetric, complex-differentiable systems, so the exact error can be recovered even without weight symmetry.",
