          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_third_most_practically_introduces_ne",
          "text": "Third, and most practically, it introduces a new homeostatic loss that reduces the asymmetry of the Jacobian directly, rather than forcing the weights themselves to be symmetric.",
          "expected_role": "figure",
          "cue_keywords": [
