          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_fourth_demonstrates_loss_finally_sca",
          "text": "And fourth, it demonstrates that with this loss, EP finally scales all the way up to ImageNet at thirty-two by thirty-two resolution.",
