          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_key_insight_improves_functional_symm",
          "text": "The key insight is that this improves functional symmetry of the Jacobian without ever forcing the weights to be symmetric.",
