          "chunk_id": "s10_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s10_c2_removing_finite_nudge_bias_exactly_c",
          "text": "By removing finite-nudge bias exactly with a Cauchy integral, and by encouraging functional symmetry of the Jacobian with a homeostatic loss instead of the weights, asymmetric networks can finally scale to ImageNet-level tasks with only a small gap to the ideal case.",
