          "chunk_id": "s10_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s10_c3_because_functional_symmetry_weaker_m",
          "text": "Because functional symmetry is a weaker, more achievable condition than weight symmetry, this opens a biologically plausible path to training real physical neural substrates, and hints that brains might rely on similar homeostatic mechanisms.",
          "expected_role": "method",
